## Ingredients
- Gin — 1 oz
- Campari — 0.75 oz
- Sweet Vermouth — 0.75 oz
- Egg white — 1 oz
- Simple syrup — 0.5 oz

## Method
Dry shake → wet shake → double strain. Garnish with a dried orange slice.

## Facts
- ABV ≈ 12%
